# 📋 STEP-BY-STEP SETUP & CONFIGURATION GUIDE:
#
# --- OPTION A: USING GITHUB ACTIONS (RECOMMENDED) ---
# 1. Fork or clone this repository to your GitHub account.
# 2. On your repository, go to: Settings > Secrets and variables > Actions.
# 3. Add the following 4 secrets by clicking "New repository secret":
#    - YOUTUBE_API_KEY      : Your YouTube Data API v3 key (Google Cloud Console)
#    - YOUTUBE_CHANNEL_ID   : Your YouTube Channel ID (e.g., UCxxxxxx)
#    - META_ACCESS_TOKEN    : Your Facebook Page Access Token (Meta Graph API Explorer)
#    - FB_PAGE_ID           : Your numeric Facebook Page ID
# 4. Enable write permissions for history tracking:
#    Go to Settings > Actions > General > Workflow permissions
#    Select "Read and write permissions" and click "Save".
# 5. Start the automation under the "Actions" tab > "Run workflow".
#
# --- OPTION B: LOCAL USE (PYTHON ON PC OR SERVER) ---
# 1. Rename this "config.txt.template" file to "config.txt".
# 2. Replace the values below with your own credentials.
# 3. Run the script using: python auto_post.py
#
# =====================================================================

YOUTUBE_API_KEY=YOUR_YOUTUBE_API_KEY
YOUTUBE_CHANNEL_ID=YOUR_YOUTUBE_CHANNEL_ID
META_ACCESS_TOKEN=YOUR_FACEBOOK_PAGE_ACCESS_TOKEN
FB_PAGE_ID=YOUR_NUMERIC_FACEBOOK_PAGE_ID
